        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe Baisiraeli inywe, muhulire ekigambo ky'Omukama, kuba inywe banyansi ba munu abakwete omushango. Timukiina bwesigwa aha ndagano, timukigilirangana kisha na Ruhanga timukimwetaireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimunahira ebyo mutakore, nimugamba ebishuba, nimwita abantu, nimwiba, nimusiyana, emiku nimugichwa yona, n'okwitangana tikulekeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo ensi elikuchulira, abanyansi baraliire kukaba, kumoi n'enyamaishwa n'ebinyonyi, nangu n'enfuru nizifa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Omuntu n'omoi atakwata bandi mushango anga kubarwanisa. Inye mbe n'inye ngamba inywe abakuhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro na mushana murata kujegurwa; kandi abarangi nabo bali kumoi nainywe. Nyinainywe, Isiraeli, nimwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bange nibafa orubi aha rw'okutanyetaho. Inywe bakuhani, ebyo ndikubegesa nimubyanga, ahonu nanye nabanga timukili bakuhani bange. Orwo mwebirwe Amateka gange nanye abana banyu ndibebwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orwo inywe abakuhani mulikweyongera kukanya nikwo mulikunfakalira kushagaho. Mbwenu kanyije mbagore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eby'abantu balikukora bakafakara nibyo bilikutungisa inywe; kityo nimugonza baikare bafakaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekibonabonyio eky'embaga nikyo nainywe abakuhani mulibona. Ndibabonabonyia mbature entambara zanyu, muzire amafu ganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulilya kyonkai timuliguta; mulifukamira baruhanga b'eilima kyonkai timulizara bana, enshonga munnagireho mwahondera baruhanga abandi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Edivai, na mpya na nkuru, emaramu abantu amagezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bange nibaraguza aha kihuuku ky'omuti! Ekiti nikyo kilikubagambira ebyo balikwenda kumanya. Okugonza obusiyani nikwo kubanagire, bakansigaho bakatera obumalaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibatamba ebitambo aha butwetwe bw'amabanga, nibahonga ebihongo aha nshozi, aha mialoni n'emilibua n'emyela aha rw'okuba miti eina ebibeho birungi. Ekilikurug'omwo bahara banyu nibatera obumalaya, kandi bakamwana banyu nibasiyana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahara banyu tibalitera bumalaya nkabaha kibonabonyio, bakamwana banyu tibalisiyana nkabaabonabonyia. Kuba abashaija nibagenda n'abamalaya nibema n'abamalaya ba rwensinga kutamba ebitambo. Bakachwa omugani bati, ‘Obutamanya bwisa abantu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“N'orwo inywe bantu ba Isiraeli mutalikungilira bwesigwa, aba Yuda batagwerwa mushango nk'ogwo. Muleke kugya Giligali anga Betiaveni kufukama anga kunahira nimugira muti, ‘Obuso bw'Omukama.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baina eijegu nk'enyana y'enkiraiziba. Nakubalisa ntai nk'omwana gw'entama omu malisizo gatangaarukire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Efuraimu bagiire aha bihuku, baleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo balikumara kutamiira bekoza eby'obusiyani; eby'enshoni nibyo balikwenda kukira eibara lirungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baliihwa omuyaga, kandi ebitambo byabo by'ekitakansi bilibagora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
